      "comment": "BONEY MALONEY (1) quickly into stride to win over the 300m at this track two runs back then raced on speed again when finishing second at this track last start. Capable of going well again. SLIPPERY UNICORN (5) goes very well at the course and distance with two wins and a placing from three starts. Scored by one length last time (16.82) in a Grade 6 over 300m at this track. Looks one of the chances. IT'S AN ACE (8) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 1.5 lengths (16.82) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Should be in this for a long way. ANTAGONIST (2) picked up a cheque last time and is in the mix again.",
